  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [metalsmith-copy](https://github.com/mattwidmann/metalsmith-copy) from `v0.3.0` to `v0.4.0`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v0.4.0\n-   [`54499da`](https://github.com/mattwidmann/metalsmith-copy/commit/54499da76597aa603542aa48235fec2219390900) Add missing closing parenthesis\n-   [`0dbfc44`](https://github.com/mattwidmann/metalsmith-copy/commit/0dbfc44ee0aec65a2d210548353c507890bf6644) Merge pull request #&#8203;13 from philippbosch/patch-1\n-   [`8c3bce1`](https://github.com/mattwidmann/metalsmith-copy/commit/8c3bce1418bb868ad91a040ee78c0cafa346738e) clean up README, update LICENSE year\n-   [`e329ec9`](https://github.com/mattwidmann/metalsmith-copy/commit/e329ec9721c7d640ebc0cccb1f310a136969f303) fix check for required options with falsy values\n-   [`1e079d1`](https://github.com/mattwidmann/metalsmith-copy/commit/1e079d18e62d6790c2c1ae38bb7d7a50ab939486) update minimatch and mocha, add package-lock.json\n-   [`9a668c0`](https://github.com/mattwidmann/metalsmith-copy/commit/9a668c09fdd5efbc18403632d7b4f4e93713e50b) fix tests for force option\n-   [`b35a48d`](https://github.com/mattwidmann/metalsmith-copy/commit/b35a48ddd651707fdf5af8588aad96bd621525a5) document overwrite behavior\n-   [`e1874a8`](https://github.com/mattwidmann/metalsmith-copy/commit/e1874a84bee81a0be91704003b82f5e6d4ba6d20) add `ignore` option\n-   [`5215daa`](https://github.com/mattwidmann/metalsmith-copy/commit/5215daa6a9cc330405b4966b55a9a7ad4bba502b) Merge branch &#x27;ignore&#x27;\n-   [`01825a4`](https://github.com/mattwidmann/metalsmith-copy/commit/01825a46ef93c16da1fe6b2a6c64bf4ed56f8b7c) bump version to 0.4.0\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
